---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="hero" class="relative pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28 border-b border-white/[0.08] overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle technical grid background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#ffffff05_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#ffffff05_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:4rem_4rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-[1360px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 relative">
    <!-- Top Meta Identifier -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-8" data-intro data-reveal="fade">
      <span class="badge-mono live">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
        Status: Rekrutacja Kohorta #01
      </span>
      <span class="badge-mono">
        B2C & B2B Engineering
      </span>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#9ca3af] hidden sm:inline">
        // 52°13'N 21°00'E • Warszawa
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Grid: Typography & Portrait -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-start">
      <!-- Left Column: Manifest & Lead (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h1 
            class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.25rem] font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.12]"
            data-intro
            data-split="lines"
          >
            Zamiast tracić miesiące na błądzenie po omacku: przejmij sprawdzoną wiedzę i buduj u siebie.
          </h1>

          <p 
            class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#9ca3af] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed font-body"
            data-intro
            data-reveal="up"
            data-delay="0.1"
          >
            Przez 300 000 lat historii człowiek nie wymyślił niczego w samotności. Prawdziwe przyspieszenie następuje wtedy, gdy przejmujesz sprawdzone wzorce od kogoś, kto już rozwiązał Twój problem. Czysta ekonomia Twojego czasu i budżetu.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Pillars Shortcut Grid -->
        <div 
          class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-t border-white/[0.08] pt-8"
          data-intro
          data-reveal="up"
          data-delay="0.2"
        >
          <a 
            href="#warsztaty" 
            class="group p-4 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.06] hover:border-blue-500/40 hover:bg-blue-500/[0.03] transition-all duration-200 min-h-[48px]"
            data-cursor="Sprawdź"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-blue-400 font-semibold">[01] WARSZTATY</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#9ca3af]">6 TYG</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">
              Orkiestracja AI
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#9ca3af] mt-1 font-mono">
              1200 PLN • Kod do 0 PLN
            </div>
          </a>

          <a 
            href="#mentoring-biznes" 
            class="group p-4 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.06] hover:border-blue-500/40 hover:bg-blue-500/[0.03] transition-all duration-200 min-h-[48px]"
            data-cursor="Termin"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-300 font-semibold">[02] MENTORING</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#9ca3af]">90 MIN</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white group-hover:text-neutral-200 transition-colors">
              Biznes & Granty
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#9ca3af] mt-1 font-mono">
              400 PLN • 1:1 online
            </div>
          </a>

          <a 
            href="#mentoring-kariera" 
            class="group p-4 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.06] hover:border-blue-500/40 hover:bg-blue-500/[0.03] transition-all duration-200 min-h-[48px]"
            data-cursor="Termin"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-300 font-semibold">[03] MENTORING</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#9ca3af]">90 MIN</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white group-hover:text-neutral-200 transition-colors">
              Kariera & Rynek
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#9ca3af] mt-1 font-mono">
              300 PLN • Audyt profilu
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Editorial Portrait & Technical Bio Card (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative" data-intro data-reveal="scale" data-delay="0.15">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.12] bg-[#12151b] group">
          <img 
            src="/images/hero.jpg" 
            alt="Łukasz Poruszek: Architekt Systemów Agentowych"
            width="896"
            height="1200"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover filter contrast-[1.05] grayscale-[20%] transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
            data-critical
          />

          <!-- Gradient Vignette & Overlay -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#090a0c] via-transparent to-transparent opacity-90"></div>

          <!-- Bottom Card Data -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 tracking-wider uppercase font-semibold">
                // ARCHITEKT WDROŻEŃ
              </div>
              <div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#9ca3af]">
                POLSKA GRUPA PROPTECH
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-white font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">
              Łukasz Poruszek
            </div>

            <div class="text-xs text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed font-mono">
              Inżynieria materiałowa • Exity technologiczne • Granty B+R (NCBR, PARP) • Autonomiczne systemy multiagentowe w produkcji.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Decorative Technical Corner Pins -->
        <div class="absolute -top-1.5 -left-1.5 w-3 h-3 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-white/40 pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-1.5 -right-1.5 w-3 h-3 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-white/40 pointer-events-none"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
